_pfet_01v8 w=75 l=0.5 m=3\nXNO VOUT IBIAS VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=100 l=1 m=3\n* Miller compensation with a left-half-plane zero\nRZ N2 NC 2.2k\nCC NC VOUT 4.5p\n.ends DUT\n"},"hash":"sha256:779b24d3ba5eef213d7fbab2d7f4d96ed17e8ff119ee5786c508c1d62448236b","id":"source-c64c2f6b688cd548","path":"submitted.spice"}],"sourcePolicy":"copy"},"symbolLibrary":{"hash":"razavi-reference-v1","id":"razavi-symbols","version":"1"},"structureRevision":0}
